' Figure 5.5 - Use-case diagram (PlantUML)
@startuml
left to right direction
actor Investor
actor Administrator
actor "Market data service" as MDS
rectangle Folium {
  usecase "Register / log in (e-mail or Google)" as U1
  usecase "Set up two-step verification" as U2
  usecase "Maintain financial profile" as U3
  usecase "Manage portfolio holdings" as U4
  usecase "Request decision analysis" as U5
  usecase "Watch live progress" as U6
  usecase "Read explanation (EN / HI)" as U7
  usecase "Download report (HTML / PDF)" as U8
  usecase "Verify audit record" as U9
  usecase "Export data / delete account" as U10
  usecase "Reset a user's two-step" as U11
}
Investor --> U1
Investor --> U2
Investor --> U3
Investor --> U4
Investor --> U5
Investor --> U6
Investor --> U7
Investor --> U8
Investor --> U9
Investor --> U10
Administrator --> U11
U4 --> MDS
U5 --> MDS
@enduml
